#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.query.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.query"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query:1 of
msgid "Query the columns of a LiteFrame with a boolean expression."
msgstr "使用布尔表达式查询 LiteFrame 的列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query:3 of
msgid ""
"The boolean expression is evaluated with :func:`liteframe_eval` and the "
"resulting single-column boolean LiteFrame is used to filter *lf* via "
"``__getitem__``, reusing the existing filter fusion.  ``inplace=True`` "
"replaces *lf*'s data with the filtered result."
msgstr ""
"布尔表达式通过 :func:`liteframe_eval` 进行求值，生成的单列布尔型 "
"LiteFrame 通过 ``__getitem__`` 来过滤 *lf*，重用现有的过滤融合功能。``"
"inplace=True`` 将 *lf* 的数据替换为过滤结果。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query:8 of
msgid ""
"Boolean expression string.  Must evaluate to a single boolean column; "
"column names resolve to :func:`~maxframe.liteframe.col` expressions."
msgstr ""
"布尔表达式字符串。必须求值为单个布尔列；列名解析为 :func:`~maxframe."
"liteframe.col` 表达式。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query:12 of
msgid ""
"If ``True``, replace *lf*'s underlying data with the filtered result and "
"return ``None``.  If ``False``, return a new filtered LiteFrame."
msgstr ""
"如果为 ``True``，用过滤结果替换 *lf* 的底层数据并返回 ``None``。如果为 ``"
"False``，返回一个新的过滤后的 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query:16 of
msgid ""
"Additional keyword arguments forwarded to :func:`liteframe_eval`, such as"
" ``local_dict``, ``global_dict``, and ``level``."
msgstr ""
"转发给 :func:`liteframe_eval` 的额外关键字参数，比如 ``local_dict``、``"
"global_dict`` 和 ``level``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query:19 of
msgid ""
"Filtered LiteFrame when ``inplace=False``; ``None`` when ``inplace=True``"
" (the mutation is applied in place)."
msgstr ""
"当 ``inplace=False`` 时返回过滤后的 LiteFrame；当 ``inplace=True`` 时返回"
" ``None``（变更在原地应用）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query:25 of
msgid ":py:obj:`eval`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_query:26 of
msgid "Evaluate a string expression on LiteFrame columns."
msgstr "在 LiteFrame 列上求值字符串表达式。"

